{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Pass the immutable release checkout SHA instead of resolving the tag again.** The Maven artifacts are built from the tag near the start of `publish`, but this separate job later re-resolves that mutable tag. If it moves between jobs, the public layer and Maven release can contain different code. Capture `git rev-parse HEAD` from the release checkout as a job output, pass that SHA here, and verify the tag still resolves to it.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sPYU9","finding_digest":"5c5650029ab1e33b63713d40d7c9a322e6f265eea7abdc5c978905cf23050417","finding_id":"arf_v1_lrlfaau2whrtwy3rhvanpsndel","finding_key":"publish_maven::publish-layer::immutable-source-selection","identity_key":"publish_maven::publish-layer::immutable-source-selection","line":148,"observation_digest":"8336cc5c8e3778fe6a456968a5c4822045b1d4362e76a94ae1f253ef1d3ac107","observation_id":"aro_v1_qm3myxeog54p42sfnfuklreceb","path":".github/workflows/publish_maven.yml","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_lrlfaau2whrtwy3rhvanpsndel","published_at":"2026-09-09T00:19:13Z","review_id":"arr_v1_klj44nq4iivrqlfw4ss2izvyx4","reviewed_base_sha":"730f534832656d1da8a3205f5468595ffb05f33d","reviewed_head_sha":"5e0e7c990b98ce37ad85186f7908258732709284","reviewer":"codex","start_line":148,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":621},"record_id":"art_v1_pot474jf4bheez34ay2lxwmqgc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T00:19:13Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
